{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation with pca_n2000 RNA encoding in a multiprofile, rna-only model, comparing against avgpool (config_002). Validation accuracy of 0.519 (F1: 0.480) is lower than config_002's 0.591 (F1: 0.573), suggesting transformer aggregation may not improve performance with pca_n2000. Uncertainty remains about the relative impact of aggregation methods when using pca_n2000 versus other encoders like scvi_n200, and whether further design choices could yield better results."
}

